-- Error cases. Each case is `-- EXPECT: <text>` followed by code up to the next
-- EXPECT. It passes when ./slap exits 1 within 5 s and stderr contains <text>.
-- `-- EXPECT-LINE: N` and `-- EXPECT-COL: N` pin the reported location.
-- Code that mentions a parse-* word gets examples/lib/parse.slap prepended.
-- Run: python3 tests/run_errors.py

